# Visual Studio cache directory
.vs/

### Metaplay-related ignores

# Build outputs
**/out/
**/bin/
**/obj/

# State dumps from checksum mismatches with server
StateDump_*.txt

# Published WebClient staged into the server image by tools/ServerImageBuild.cs
/Backend/Server/publicwebapp/

# Pre-built WASM serializer, generated by tools/SerializerGen when WebClient builds
/WebClient/Serializer/

**/node_modules/

# Metaplay client storage
**/PersistentData/
**/TemporaryCache/

# Python bytecode cache, e.g. from importing tools/run-e2e.py in a check
__pycache__/
